	"Se cultivó en Veggie durante VEG-03 (2017) junto a la lechuga romana roja y la col china. En VEG-04 (2019) la NASA la usó para probar distintas mezclas de luz roja, azul y verde y ver cómo cambian su crecimiento y su sabor.": "It was grown in Veggie during VEG-03 (2017) together with red romaine lettuce and Chinese cabbage. In VEG-04 (2019) NASA used it to test different mixes of red, blue and green light and see how they change its growth and flavor.",
